WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.477 --> 00:00:02.258
- I'll give you one guess. (laughs hard)

00:00:03.488 --> 00:00:04.529
(chuckles)

00:00:10.029 --> 00:00:11.024
- Ooh.

00:00:11.024 --> 00:00:12.417
- My what?
- [Woman] Pictionary skills.

00:00:12.947 --> 00:00:14.268
- No, I'm really bad.

00:00:14.268 --> 00:00:14.913
- I hate games!

00:00:14.913 --> 00:00:15.633
- Terrible.

00:00:15.633 --> 00:00:17.514
- I'm probably not that great at it.

00:00:17.514 --> 00:00:18.292
We shall see.

00:00:20.512 --> 00:00:21.580
(chuckles)

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:22.261
- Oh, any character?

00:00:22.261 --> 00:00:23.435
And then you're gonna guess.

00:00:23.435 --> 00:00:24.874
That's how pictionary works.

00:00:24.874 --> 00:00:26.592
- Okay, I know who I'm gonna draw.

00:00:26.592 --> 00:00:27.799
- Whooa!

00:00:27.799 --> 00:00:29.018
- I'm about to draw the easiest one,

00:00:29.018 --> 00:00:29.900
I know how to draw.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.775
- I don't have a technique,
so don't judge me.

00:00:32.775 --> 00:00:35.249
- There is so much technique,
are you kidding me?

00:00:35.249 --> 00:00:36.355
- That's supposed to be the ear.

00:00:36.355 --> 00:00:37.632
- These are feathers, I guess.

00:00:37.632 --> 00:00:38.840
- That's supposed to be the chin.

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:40.509
- I'm such a bad drawer.

00:00:40.509 --> 00:00:41.614
- Oh, my God, that's horrible.

00:00:41.614 --> 00:00:42.311
Hold up.

00:00:42.311 --> 00:00:43.715
- Yasmin's gonna, kill me.

00:00:43.715 --> 00:00:44.772
- I suck at this.

00:00:44.772 --> 00:00:46.492
- I give up. (chuckles)

00:00:48.272 --> 00:00:49.133
- Gorgeous!
- [Woman] Okay, so

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:50.734
who did you draw?

00:00:50.734 --> 00:00:53.260
- I drew Yasmin. Nimah.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.787
- You are gonna judge me but
you gonna tell who it is.

00:00:55.787 --> 00:00:56.755
Bam!

00:00:56.755 --> 00:00:57.965
See what I'm saying?

00:00:57.965 --> 00:00:59.761
You see that is crazy!

00:00:59.761 --> 00:01:01.991
- Sorry Kate, I made her the Joker.

00:01:01.991 --> 00:01:02.601
- Do you like?

00:01:02.601 --> 00:01:04.005
Do you know who that is?

00:01:04.005 --> 00:01:04.985
Black Cindy.

00:01:04.985 --> 00:01:06.490
- I'm the worst, I'm fired.

00:01:06.490 --> 00:01:07.777
(chuckles)

00:01:08.767 --> 00:01:10.501
Let me guess, Crazy Eyes?

00:01:11.231 --> 00:01:13.948
- No! I'm kidding, I'm
kidding, I'm kidding!

00:01:13.948 --> 00:01:15.202
- I'm like, no!?
- [Samira] What if I was that,

00:01:15.202 --> 00:01:16.364
what if I was that bad.

00:01:16.364 --> 00:01:17.838
- [Woman] Oh no, it's Piper!

00:01:19.038 --> 00:01:20.511
- Piper, season 4.

00:01:20.511 --> 00:01:21.527
- Do you want to...

00:01:21.947 --> 00:01:23.760
Yes, it is. Here we go.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:25.289
Beautiful isn't it?

00:01:25.289 --> 00:01:26.475
True work of art.

00:01:26.475 --> 00:01:28.478
(upbeat music)

00:01:31.769 --> 00:01:32.959
(laughs)

00:01:32.964 --> 00:01:34.589
- Beautiful job. (overlapping chatter)

